#title[Service Number Improvements]

You can now use the service number feature for trains more conveniently in px-patch.

In a train's Go to station or Go to waypoint order, open the drop-down menu to find the service number options; click `Service number: Set service number from here…` to conveniently set the service number the train starts using at this station.

#figure(
  image("../../static/images/service-num-set.png", width: 80%),
)

After turning on the `Show vehicle route ID in vehicle view window` option in the settings, the service number currently being executed will be shown after the vehicle name in the vehicle window.

#figure(
  image("../../static/images/service-num-show-setting.png", width: 80%),
)

The departures board of a station will also show the service number instead of the vehicle name by default.
